<p class="callout-dark__body">Research consistently shows that lighting quality impacts patient recovery, staff alertness, and error reduction. Flicker-free operation eliminates headache-triggering strobe effects. High CRI ensures accurate visual assessment. Tunable CCT allows circadian-supportive lighting schedules — brighter/cooler during daytime, warmer/dimmer at night.</p>
